{"lines": [{"text": "This plane has 180 seats, but the airline sold 190 tickets.", "start": 0.5, "end": 5.564, "spec": null, "words": [["This", 0.08, 0.193], ["plane", 0.193, 0.477], ["has", 0.477, 0.727], ["180", 0.727, 1.523], ["seats", 1.523, 2.17], ["but", 2.375, 2.466], ["the", 2.466, 2.545], ["airline", 2.636, 3.08], ["sold", 3.08, 3.466], ["190", 3.477, 4.182], ["tickets", 4.193, 4.727]]}, {"text": "That's not a mistake. It's a calculated bet.", "start": 5.814, "end": 8.454, "spec": null, "words": [["That's", 0.091, 0.227], ["not", 0.227, 0.375], ["a", 0.375, 0.398], ["mistake", 0.398, 0.898], ["It's", 1.273, 1.364], ["a", 1.364, 1.42], ["calculated", 1.42, 1.943], ["bet", 1.943, 2.295]]}, {"text": "On a typical flight, roughly one in twenty passengers never shows up.", "start": 8.704, "end": 12.76, "spec": null, "words": [["On", 0.08, 0.148], ["a", 0.159, 0.216], ["typical", 0.216, 0.557], ["flight", 0.557, 0.943], ["roughly", 1.193, 1.545], ["one", 1.545, 1.795], ["in", 1.795, 1.909], ["twenty", 1.909, 2.193], ["passengers", 2.193, 2.83], ["never", 2.977, 3.182], ["shows", 3.182, 3.489], ["up", 3.489, 3.727]]}, {"text": "Business travelers change plans, connections run late, and some people simply oversleep.", "start": 13.01, "end": 18.986, "spec": null, "words": [["Business", 0.091, 0.398], ["travelers", 0.409, 0.875], ["change", 0.886, 1.25], ["plans", 1.261, 1.818], ["connections", 1.955, 2.489], ["run", 2.489, 2.773], ["late", 2.784, 3.114], ["and", 3.318, 3.511], ["some", 3.886, 4.136], ["people", 4.136, 4.534], ["simply", 4.58, 5.057], ["oversleep", 5.057, 5.648]]}, {"text": "An empty seat earns nothing, yet the plane burns almost the same fuel and needs the same crew.", "start": 19.236, "end": 25.26, "spec": null, "words": [["An", 0.08, 0.17], ["empty", 0.182, 0.42], ["seat", 0.42, 0.784], ["earns", 0.932, 1.193], ["nothing", 1.193, 1.648], ["yet", 2.011, 2.114], ["the", 2.114, 2.182], ["plane", 2.182, 2.5], ["burns", 2.511, 2.92], ["almost", 2.932, 3.318], ["the", 3.318, 3.386], ["same", 3.386, 3.739], ["fuel", 3.75, 4.227], ["and", 4.466, 4.614], ["needs", 4.625, 4.898], ["the", 4.898, 4.977], ["same", 4.989, 5.295], ["crew", 5.295, 5.705]]}, {"text": "So airlines study every route's no-show history and sell just enough extra tickets to cover the gaps.", "start": 25.51, "end": 32.326, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.273], ["airlines", 0.273, 0.727], ["study", 0.739, 1.136], ["every", 1.261, 1.568], ["route's", 1.568, 2.034], ["no-show", 2.045, 2.523], ["history", 2.523, 3.045], ["and", 3.193, 3.318], ["sell", 3.33, 3.75], ["just", 4.011, 4.273], ["enough", 4.284, 4.602], ["extra", 4.739, 5.023], ["tickets", 5.034, 5.455], ["to", 5.614, 5.693], ["cover", 5.693, 5.909], ["the", 5.909, 5.955], ["gaps", 5.955, 6.466]]}, {"text": "Most days the math works: the extra passengers fill the empty seats, and nobody notices.", "start": 32.576, "end": 38.264, "spec": null, "words": [["Most", 0.091, 0.318], ["days", 0.318, 0.591], ["the", 0.591, 0.659], ["math", 0.67, 1.091], ["works", 1.102, 1.614], ["the", 1.977, 2.068], ["extra", 2.068, 2.33], ["passengers", 2.341, 2.864], ["fill", 2.864, 3.114], ["the", 3.114, 3.193], ["empty", 3.205, 3.511], ["seats", 3.511, 4.102], ["and", 4.273, 4.432], ["nobody", 4.443, 4.75], ["notices", 4.75, 5.352]]}, {"text": "Fuller planes also split the flight's cost among more people, which helps keep fares lower.", "start": 38.514, "end": 43.842, "spec": null, "words": [["Fuller", 0.125, 0.364], ["planes", 0.375, 0.852], ["also", 0.966, 1.295], ["split", 1.307, 1.693], ["the", 1.705, 1.784], ["flight's", 1.795, 2.159], ["cost", 2.159, 2.545], ["among", 2.557, 2.841], ["more", 2.841, 3.068], ["people", 3.068, 3.455], ["which", 3.784, 3.875], ["helps", 3.875, 4.057], ["keep", 4.057, 4.295], ["fares", 4.295, 4.625], ["lower", 4.636, 4.989]]}, {"text": "But sometimes everyone shows up, and the gate agent has to start an auction.", "start": 44.092, "end": 48.7, "spec": null, "words": [["But", 0.091, 0.159], ["sometimes", 0.17, 0.875], ["everyone", 1.011, 1.386], ["shows", 1.386, 1.75], ["up", 1.75, 2.011], ["and", 2.455, 2.534], ["the", 2.545, 2.636], ["gate", 2.636, 2.898], ["agent", 2.977, 3.307], ["has", 3.307, 3.5], ["to", 3.511, 3.58], ["start", 3.591, 3.795], ["an", 3.795, 3.841], ["auction", 3.852, 4.273]]}, {"text": "Who will take a later flight for a 200 dollar voucher? No one? 300? 400?", "start": 48.95, "end": 54.35, "spec": null, "words": [["Who", 0.102, 0.136], ["will", 0.136, 0.216], ["take", 0.227, 0.398], ["a", 0.398, 0.443], ["later", 0.443, 0.761], ["flight", 0.761, 1.114], ["for", 1.182, 1.352], ["a", 1.352, 1.409], ["200 dollar", 1.42, 2.011], ["voucher", 2.011, 2.477], ["No", 2.852, 3.0], ["one", 3.0, 3.205], ["300", 3.636, 4.17], ["400", 4.58, 5.068]]}, {"text": "The offer keeps climbing until someone says yes, because that is still cheaper than a plane full of angry passengers.", "start": 54.6, "end": 61.68, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.091, 0.159], ["offer", 0.159, 0.443], ["keeps", 0.455, 0.693], ["climbing", 0.693, 1.159], ["until", 1.227, 1.466], ["someone", 1.466, 1.761], ["says", 1.761, 2.057], ["yes", 2.057, 2.591], ["because", 2.784, 3.159], ["that", 3.17, 3.352], ["is", 3.352, 3.455], ["still", 3.466, 3.818], ["cheaper", 3.83, 4.341], ["than", 4.352, 4.443], ["a", 4.443, 4.489], ["plane", 4.489, 4.955], ["full", 5.182, 5.5], ["of", 5.5, 5.602], ["angry", 5.716, 5.989], ["passengers", 6.0, 6.727]]}, {"text": "Getting bumped against your will is rare, typically just a few people in every 100,000.", "start": 61.93, "end": 67.666, "spec": null, "words": [["Getting", 0.091, 0.318], ["bumped", 0.432, 0.818], ["against", 0.83, 1.125], ["your", 1.125, 1.25], ["will", 1.25, 1.477], ["is", 1.489, 1.602], ["rare", 1.602, 2.068], ["typically", 2.511, 2.932], ["just", 2.932, 3.102], ["a", 3.102, 3.148], ["few", 3.159, 3.477], ["people", 3.477, 3.898], ["in", 4.102, 4.25], ["every", 4.33, 4.58], ["100,000", 4.58, 5.398]]}, {"text": "So what price would make you give up your seat?", "start": 67.916, "end": 69.788, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.216], ["what", 0.216, 0.33], ["price", 0.33, 0.625], ["would", 0.625, 0.716], ["make", 0.716, 0.841], ["you", 0.841, 0.909], ["give", 0.909, 1.034], ["up", 1.034, 1.114], ["your", 1.114, 1.205], ["seat", 1.216, 1.545]]}], "dur": 71.59}